            <note corresp="#d319-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d319-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, INCO–COTTON GATT. Limited Official Use; Priority. There is no time of
                    transmission on the source text; the telegram was received at 7:37 a.m. Repeated
                    to Bonn, Brussels for USEC, The Hague, Hong
                    Kong, London, Luxembourg for USEC, New Delhi,
                    Paris for USOECD, Rawalpindi, Rome, and Tokyo
                    and passed to the White House.</p>
            </note>
